- **Required tests are incomplete.** The “history overflow” test exercises live-byte overflow, not cumulative history overflow. Add admitted/released logical-byte exhaustion. Add cancellation during copying a nonempty replacement, verifying preserved original contents/capacity and retained replacement history. Assert exact capacity-based history deltas.

